  "worked_solution": "Notice that we have a block diagonal matrix. Therefore, its determinant is equal to the product of the diagonal blocks' determinants:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\begin{aligned}x & 1 & 10 & 0 \\\\ 2 & y & 0 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 0 & z & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}| & =|\\begin{aligned}x & 1 & 10 & 0 \\\\ 2 & y & 0 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 0 & z & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}x & 1 & 10 \\\\ 2 & y & 0 \\\\ 5 & 0 & z\\end{aligned}|\\cdot 3 \\\\  & =8\\cdot 3 \\\\  & =24.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
